Best game to waste your precious study time with.
Amazing sci-fi 5th person shooter that includes realistic strategic diversity, such as:
Unbelievable team communication, due to:
- Incredible whistling technique;
- In-depth vehicle beep mechanics;
- Fascinating map opening skills;
Marvelous game physics, for example:
- Tanks blowing up after hitting a broken wooden fence;
- Cars rolling over on flat ground;
- Bikers being able to jump off a 3km high cliff and still landing undamaged on the ground, perfectly.
- One sidecar being able to seat 20 passengers;
Unimaginable weapon balance, examples:
- Bolt action rifles are one shot one kill to the toe;
- SMGs (except Thompson) requiring 20 bullets to the chest to get a target down to 50%;
- Takes 20 hits to the head with a shovel to injure a person;
And much more...
Overall: 7.8/10 too much water

